OL,3,A'We don't need new laws,' Nvidia boss
OL,4,Asays as he calls for self-regulation on
OL,5,AAI
OL,6,
OL,7,FNvidia chief executive Jensen Huang
OL,8,Fsays there's no need for new laws on AI
OL,9,F- instead AI companies should "simply
OL,10,Fnot release anything that they are not
OL,11,Fconfident will be safe"
OL,13,FHe's one of several AI bosses speaking
OL,14,Fat a conference in California.
OL,15,FAnthropic's boss says it is tempting to
OL,16,F"attack" competitors but it is more
OL,17,Fresponsible to try and establish
OL,18,Findustry-wide standards
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
