OL,3,A'We don't need new laws,' Nvidia boss
OL,4,Asays as he calls for self-regulation on
OL,5,AAI
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeanwhile, Senator Bernie Sanders calls
OL,8,Fon the US to work with China on AI
OL,9,Fregulation, saying a treaty should be
OL,10,Festablished to pause development on "AI
OL,11,Fsuperintelligence"
OL,13,FHis remarks were made at a summit in
OL,14,FWashington, where Steve Bannon, a
OL,15,Fformer Trump adviser, called AI the
OL,16,F"defining issue of our time" - their
OL,17,Fjoint appearance is a rare show of
OL,18,Fbipartisanship, writes our Washington
OL,19,Fcorrespondent
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
